  "summary": "Postinstall exfiltrates installer host identifiers to webhook.site",
  "details": "The package's postinstall hook runs index.js, which collects the installer's OS username, current working directory, hostname, and local IPv4 address and POSTs them as JSON to a hardcoded webhook.site collector URL (https://webhook.site/f9bff304-3053-4d54-be05-86537267514a) on npm install. The package name is a random keyboard-mash string with no documented purpose, and the only on-install behavior is the outbound beacon to an anonymous ephemeral webhook endpoint controlled by whoever created the webhook.site token.",
